  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dialogue and knowledge sharing of research . Knowledge in action programme.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance knowledge management and exchange associated with development research projects funded by Danida/MoFA. The grant to DFC will be used to support a range of knowledge management activities. These include researcher mobility, research networks, dissemination of research results through seminars and publications, etc. Funds will also be available for special purpose studies and analyses of cross-cutting issues in development research</narrative>
  </description>
